  "changes": [
    "Retargeted authored Collada performances to the existing CC0 infantry and villager rigs by source world bone directions and measured target rest orientations. No Age of Empires assets are included.",
    "Preserved target bone lengths, skin weights, mesh shapes and texture identity. Only applicable role clips are included per rig.",
    "Sampled quaternion and root-position tracks at 30 Hz, normalized quaternion signs and packed quaternions as signed 16-bit values.",
    "Grounded sole contact against deformed boot vertices. Authored running retains a bounded airborne interval; runtime support probes correct transition penetration.",
    "Calibrated locomotion stride from the backward velocity of planted feet. Runtime gait phase uses distance actually travelled and a stable per-unit phase; idle and work remain independent of walking.",
    "Derived relaxed/closed palm morphs from the original hand-weighted mesh vertices. Existing rigs have no articulated finger bones. These local morphs close the fingers without adding replacement hand geometry.",
    "Fitted +Y equipment shafts through measured palm grips; two-handed axe, pick and hoe actions are fitted through both closed palms. Fitted the bow action prop orientation at full draw.",
    "Kept the existing authored horse and trebuchet models, action interfaces and collision envelopes unchanged.",
    "Aligned the bow fire marker to normalized clip phase 0.46 after actual pose inspection. Mirrored the local bow curve to the corrected grip, and bounded palm-driven string travel to 0.65 m during pose blending."
  ],
